### Requisições de exemplo (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Criar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Perini",
  "email": "ana@exemplo.com"
}

### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Buscar usuário por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Atualizar usuário
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana L. Perini"
}

### Remover usuário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Criar curso
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture",
  "description": "Curso sobre arquitetura limpa aplicada a APIs.",
  "workload": 40
}

### Listar cursos
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses

### Buscar curso por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/1

### Atualizar curso
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workload": 60
}

### Remover curso
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/1

### Criar matrícula
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "course_id": 1
}

### Listar matrículas
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollments

### Cancelar matrícula
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/1

### Consulta relacional: usuário + cursos matriculados
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/courses
